<title>THAILAND: TABLE-Thai June BOP deficit 24.6 bln baht.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Thai June BOP deficit 24.6 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's balance of payments deficit narrowed to 24.6 billion in June from 112.3 billion in May, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    BALANCE OF PAYMENTS	  June 97     May 97    June 96</p>
<p>					  -24.6	 -112.3     +20.5</p>
<p>Note - The figures are in billions of baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
